    "note": "370 W total PoE power with 90 W a port on the 12 PoE++ ports (ports 13 and 14 carry no PoE). The vendor PoE table prints 14 ports at 15.4 W, 12 at 30 W, 6 at 60 W and 4 at 90 W - so at 90 W only four of the twelve ports can be powered together, and its af column (14) exceeds the 12 PoE ports the port table gives."
